        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Thanpui ramkhou guang puanmei 0({,",
            "Tingkauh ganchuanga rui njuan ne;",
            "Ntakmei kata phumei nun rui,",
            "Ganchuanga ta jao na,",
            "Ata banchuang ganmei 0({ rui na,",
            "Guang puanpui bam Bethlehem jai gaungtang lou.",
            "",
            "Chorus:",
            "He Bethlehem ching guangtang maksan,",
            "Thak maknga ai tat ni;",
            "Kalan ganchuannga rui jai guang louna,",
            "Mary rui puan bammei nga na ta hou ni.",
            "",
            "2. Tingsang Salem changmun daimeiTei akhang rui lanlou dat kan the;",
            "Man pui kandih khou bammei nun ta,",
            "Ningtingmei ti sulou,",
            "Neilana thuan kho Guang than puanmei ta,",
            "Kandih hei tingsang gaipui lu padik diu.",
            "",
            "3. Adi neila cho guang than ta,",
            "Tingkauh mei nun rui tithai lou the;",
            "Kata ninga tingkauh mei nun rui,",
            "Kandih khou hei jao kei,",
            "Tingkauh ganchuanga nang rui bam phulou,",
            "Puanpui bam Bethlehem jai guangtang lou ni.",
            "",
            "4. He tat dikho aniu tao hei,",
            "Gaipui ram njuan na tat dikho;",
            "Kandih guang nun rui jaoji sini,",
            "Mei kapumma rui ni,",
            "Guang dailiangmei e ai ning thuk liange,",
            "Tingkauh gaipui ram jaiguang tang lou puni."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
